# This GitHub repo is platform-only. Keep legacy/Lovable app files local as
# reference, but don't track them from the workspace root.
*
!.gitignore
!platform/
!platform/**
# CI config lives at the repo root, so it needs the same allowlisting as
# platform/. Without both lines git never descends into the directory and
# silently drops the workflows from every commit -- which it did once already.
!.github/
!.github/**
